   "slot": 4,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 303,
   "h": 130,
   "style": "df70507b",
   "content": "16a900ce",
   "text": "本次修订收敛 HTTPProxy 的信任模型：terminal_id 不再被视为稳定身份，也不得"
